# Local security notes (not for version control)
/security/

# Generated by scripts/entra/apply-frontend.mjs at build time. Never committed:
# committing them would recreate the in-tree drift the codemod exists to avoid.
#
# This list must stay in sync with the LOGO_TARGETS and TEMPLATES arrays in
# scripts/entra/apply-frontend.mjs -- a template added there without a
# matching entry here would land untracked-but-committable, and nothing in
# CI catches that on its own (the idempotency check in
# .github/workflows/build-entra.yml only flags a file the SECOND codemod run
# creates that the first run didn't; a consistently-forgotten .gitignore
# entry looks identical between the two runs). Update this list by hand
# whenever those arrays change.
apps/*/app/assets/logos/microsoft-logo.svg
apps/admin/app/(all)/(dashboard)/authentication/microsoft/
apps/admin/components/authentication/microsoft-config.tsx
